 "defect_observations": [
  "Inherited definition: thm:p15-submartingale-ui and thm:p15-closed-martingale use 'submartingale'/'martingale' from def:p15-filtration-martingale (handbook/parts/p15/martingales-and-convergence.tex 15-30). That definition defines adaptedness but does not require it of a martingale or submartingale. Annex 217-221 (the bracket E(X_inf|F_n)-X_n is treated as F_n-measurable) and annex 234-235 ('X_n is integrable and F_n-measurable') rely on adaptedness. The fix belongs to the martingales-and-convergence unit's C001 duty. It does not leave any text in this unit missing.",
  "thm:p15-changing-conditional-limits (body 188) asserts |Y|<=Z a.s. for the dominated case. The annex uses this (318-319, and W_N<=2Z at 321-322) without writing the one-line pointwise-limit justification. This is a minor presentation point and has no coverage effect.",
  "Body 357-363 points to sec:p15-exchangeability-and-definetti for the remaining Section 4.7 applications. Those are outside this unit's 21 components, so this is not a placeholder for a component of this unit."
 ],
